ARCHITECTURE.md

# Running record of the Phase 2 security and scale review — what changed, what
# it relies on, and the tooling traps that cost time. Local-only by choice.
docs/hardening-log.md

# The plain-English companion to the log, for briefing management. Same
# reasoning, and arguably more so: it describes every weakness we found in
# deliberately clear language, which is exactly what makes it readable by
# someone who should not have it. It was tracked by oversight until 18 Sep
# 2026 — this line is the fix going forward; earlier commits still hold it.
docs/hardening-summary-plain-english.md

# Period summaries that feed the monthly management report. Same material as the
# two documents above, condensed — so the same reasoning applies. Remove this
# line deliberately if a report is meant to be shared through the repository
# rather than sent.
